content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Receptionist",
      "description": "Handles patient registration, appointments, and record updates."
    },
    {
      "name": "Registration",
      "description": "Process of recording patient details for admission or visit."
    },
    {
      "name": "Patient",
      "description": "Person receiving medical care or treatment.",
      "attributes": [
        "Patient Record"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Patient Record",
      "description": "Collection of a patient’s medical history and current health data.",
      "attributes": [
        "Medical History",
        "Symptoms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Medical History",
      "description": "Information about past illnesses and treatments."
    },
    {
      "name": "Symptoms",
      "description": "Patient-reported signs of illness or discomfort."
    },
    {
      "name": "Appointment",
      "description": "Scheduled meeting between a patient and a doctor.",
      "attributes": [
        "Doctor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Doctor",
      "description": "Diagnoses patients, prescribes treatment, and requests tests."
    },
    {
      "name": "Diagnosis",
      "description": "Result of medical evaluation identifying patient’s condition."
    },
    {
      "name": "Prescription",
      "description": "Doctor’s order for medication or therapy.",
      "attributes": [
        "Medication"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Medication",
      "description": "Drug prescribed to treat a patient’s condition."
    },
    {
      "name": "Lab Worker",
      "description": "Performs tests and prepares lab results for doctors."
    },
    {
      "name": "Lab Test Request",
      "description": "Request from a doctor for lab analysis or testing."
    },
    {
      "name": "Test Result",
      "description": "Outcome of lab test used for diagnosis confirmation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Nurse",
      "description": "Assists doctors, monitors patients, and gives medication."
    },
    {
      "name": "Pharmacist",
      "description": "Prepares and dispenses prescribed medication."
    },
    {
      "name": "Medication Inventory",
      "description": "Stock record of available drugs in pharmacy."
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Reception": {
      "objects": [
        "Receptionist",
        "Registration",
        "Patient",
        "Patient Record",
        "Medical History",
        "Symptoms"
      ]
    },
    "Appointment": {
      "objects": [
        "Doctor",
        "Patient",
        "Diagnosis",
        "Prescription",
        "Medication",
        "Nurse"
      ]
    },
    "Lab": {
      "objects": [
        "Lab Test Request",
        "Lab Worker",
        "Test Result"
      ]
    },
    "Pharmacy": {
      "objects": [
        "Pharmacist",
        "Medication Inventory",
        "Medication"
      ]
    },
    "subdomain connections": [
      "Reception--Appointment",
      "Appointment--Lab",
      "Appointment--Pharmacy"
    ]
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Reception": {
      "derived from": "Reception Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Receptionist",
        "Registration",
        "Visitor",
        "Patient Record",
        "Medical History",
        "Symptoms"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Patient -> Visitor"
      ]
    },
    "Appointment": {
      "derived from": "Appointment Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Doctor",
        "Patient",
        "Diagnosis",
        "Prescription",
        "Medication",
        "Nurse"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Lab": {
      "derived from": "Lab Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Lab Test Request",
        "Lab Worker",
        "Test Result"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Pharmacy": {
      "derived from": "Pharmacy Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Pharmacist",
        "Medication Inventory",
        "Medication"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Medication -> Medication Stock"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
